  "outcome": "escalate",
  "rationale": "We are escalating this claim because the automated findings indicate it is unclear whether an exclusion applies, specifically regarding the claimant's potential commercial use of the vehicle when transporting items for gas money. Under Section 6, claims with open or unclear coverage questions must be escalated for further investigation rather than approved.",
  "citations": [
    {
      "clause_id": "PLUS-6.2",
      "quote": "If the documents submitted do not allow the adjuster to determine whether an exclusion applies, because material facts are disputed, missing or open to more than one reasonable reading, the claim must be escalated for further investigation rather than approved or denied on the information available."
    }
  ]
}
